sequenceDiagram
    actor Requester
    participant Orders as Order service
    participant DB as Postgres

    Requester->>Orders: POST /api/v1/orders/{orderId}/acknowledge
    Note over Orders: requester, COLLECTED or DELIVERED, acknowledgement window still open
    Orders->>DB: ACKNOWLEDGED and settled_at = now
    Note over DB: outbox credit.reservation.release, reason ACKNOWLEDGED
    Note over DB: outbox rating.permission.granted, requester rates courier
    Orders-->>Requester: 200 ACKNOWLEDGED
